WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.660
Eighty kilometres from the

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.160
Arabian Sea, a river sets out

3
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.600
for the Bay of Bengal.

4
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.050
The long way.

5
00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:09.334
The Godavari rises at

6
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.474
Trimbakeshwar, near Nashik, in

7
00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:13.434
the Western Ghats, about nine

8
00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:15.194
hundred and twenty metres up.

9
00:00:15.194 --> 00:00:17.254
Then it turns east across the

10
00:00:17.254 --> 00:00:18.604
