14
00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:27.183
Then the tributaries arrive.

15
00:00:27.183 --> 00:00:29.283
First the Pranahita, carrying

16
00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:31.203
the Wardha, Wainganga and

17
00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:33.103
Penganga, about a third of the

18
00:00:33.103 --> 00:00:35.543
basin. Then the Indravati, the

19
00:00:35.543 --> 00:00:37.463
second largest, from Odisha and

20
00:00:37.463 --> 00:00:38.823
Chhattisgarh.

21
00:00:39.024 --> 00:00:40.844
Past Bhadrachalam, the river

22
00:00:40.844 --> 00:00:43.044
bends south east into Andhra

23
00:00:43.044 --> 00:00:43.934
Pradesh.

24
00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:46.337
At Rajahmundry, the Dowleswaram

25
00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:48.157
Barrage holds it once more.

26
00:00:48.157 --> 00:00:50.377
Here it splits into the Gautami

27
00:00:50.377 --> 00:00:52.777
and Vasishta branches, and five

28
00:00:52.777 --> 00:00:53.797
