33
00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:04.952
India's second longest river,

34
00:01:04.952 --> 00:01:06.452
the Dakshina Ganga.

35
00:01:06.452 --> 00:01:08.512
Not bad for a river that starts

36
00:01:08.512 --> 00:01:10.802
