37
00:01:12.293 --> 00:01:13.073
For GS1:

38
00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.213
the Godavari rises near Nashik,

39
00:01:15.213 --> 00:01:18.533
crosses the Deccan, gathers the

40
00:01:18.533 --> 00:01:20.733
Pranahita and Indravati, and

41
00:01:20.733 --> 00:01:22.093
reaches the Bay of Bengal

42
00:01:22.093 --> 00:01:23.603
through a delta.

43
00:01:24.439 --> 00:01:26.839
One river, a plateau tilted

44
00:01:26.839 --> 00:01:30.089
east, and a long way to the sea.
